<title>USA: N.Y. Mortgage Agency bonds free to trade.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Mortgage Agency bonds free to trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>STATE OF NEW YORK MORTGAGE AGENCY</p>
<p>RE: $75,000,000</p>
<p>HOMEOWNER MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 58 (AMT)</p>
<p>SERIES 59 (NON-AMT)</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The Bank of New York</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>First Albany Corporation</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Prudential Securities Incorporated</p>
<p>Samuel A. Ramirez &amp; Company, Inc.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
